'''Frosty''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. They sell [[Frosty the Snow Cannon]] and refill it for a cost.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Frosty&f: Welcome to the &cJerry's Workshop&f.
&e[NPC] Frosty&f: Here the Jerrys make and deliver &aGifts &fto all of SkyBlock!
&e[NPC] Frosty&f: When its time to deliver Gifts, &cMount Jerry&f always erupts and the village is ravaged by heat-based enemies!
&e[NPC] Frosty&f: It is up to you, &b[player]&f, to help save the day. Take this &aSnow Cannon&f to aid you in your defense against the &cMagma Grinches&f.
&e[NPC] Frosty&f: It holds and fires &bSnowballs&f, which are the best way to extinguish the enemy!
&e[NPC] Frosty&f: I can refill it at any time for a modest price. Also feel free to check out my shop upstairs!
}}
|-
| class="ct" | With [[Frosty the Snow Cannon|Snow Cannon]] or [[Frosty the Snow Blaster|Blaster]]
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Frosty&f: Click me with a Snow Cannon, Snow Blaster, or Frosty the Howitzer to refill it!}}
|- class="article-row-main"
| class="ct" | Without [[Frosty the Snow Cannon|Snow Cannon]] or [[Frosty the Snow Blaster|Blaster]]
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Frosty&f: I noticed you don't have a Snow Cannon, would you like to buy another?|text=}}
