'''Generow''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}} only in the month of December. They can be talked to to see [[Gifts|Gifting]] Milestones.

== Gifting Milestones ==
'''Generow''' grants the [[Player]] rewards based on how many gifts they've given to unique Players. When holding a [[Gifts|Gift]], players will see a green {{Rmt|&a✉}} above players they have not gifted to before and a red {{Rmt|&c✉}} above those they have already gifted to.

== Rewards ==
{{/UI}}
The cumulative rewards at {{Rmt|&aLevel XXV (25)}} are:

* {{Item|North Stars|amount=40}}
* {{Item|Ice Essence|amount=80}}
* {{Item|Frozen Bait|amount=360}}
* {{Item|Gift of Learning|amount=8}}
* {{Item|Einary's Red Hoodie}}
* {{Item|Expensive Toy}}
* Gift of Giving [[SkyBlock Levels#Emblems|Emblem]] {{Rmt|&6✉}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fOh, hello there!
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fYou look like someone who appreciates the finer points of gifting, am I right?
&eSelect an option: &a[&aWho are you?&a]
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[Who are you?]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fAh, where are my manners?
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fI'm Generow, the coolest gift-loving penguin you'll ever meet!
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fI live for two things: receiving gifts and gifting others.
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fBut I must admit, the latter warms my feathers even more!
&eSelect an option: &a[&aWhat are you doing here?&a]
}}
|- class="article-row-main"
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[What are you doing here?]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fWell, you see, this December is special.
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fI've come to reward those who share the joy of gifting!
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fGift enough &ddifferent &fplayers, and you'll earn yourself something extraordinary!
&eSelect an option: &a[&aTell me more about these rewards.&a]
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[Tell me more about these rewards.]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fAh, eager to know, are we?
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fThe more players you gift, the better your reward.
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fIt's all about spreading the cheer, you see.
&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: &fCheck this out!
}}
|-
| class="ct" | After hitting a milestone
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: (gifts} Unique Gifts! Wow!/&e[NPC] &6Generow&f: Click to claim your reward!}}
|}

