'''Tia the Fairy''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Wilderness}}. They provide the player with stat boosts in exchange for [[Fairy Souls]].

== Quest ==
For every five [[Fairy Souls]] that the [[player]] exchanges with Tia, they will recieve {{SkyBlock XP|10}} and will unlock [[Backpack]] slots at exchange #1, #2, #4, #6, #8, #10, #13, #16, #19, #22, #25, #28, #31, #34, #37, #40, and #44; or in other words, after giving Tia 5, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 65, 80, 95, 110, 125, 140. 155, 170, 185, 200, and 220 Fairy Souls respectively.
To obtain the boosts, the player must have at least five [[Fairy Souls]]. If the player has more than five souls, Tia will still only take five at a time.

=== 9f™ Network Quest ===
{{Main|9f™ Network}}
After adding '''Tia the Fairy''' on player's [[Abiphone]], a {{Item|9f™ Operator Chip}} will be added into it. It will stay there as long as '''Tia''' is a contact. Wearing {{Item|Fairy Armor}} allows the player to receive relays, where '''Tia''' will call the [[player]] and tell the player where the [[9f™ Network]] that needs to be completed is.

