== Tasks ==
{{Outdated|Tracking and Finnegan Changes}}
Upon interacting with '''Trevor''', he will offer the choice to start a quest to find and kill an animal. Accepting the task will spawn a mob will be somewhere on the [[Mushroom Desert]].

The mob is invisible to other players, but is not immune to external damage. If the mob manages to die from environmental damage, the {{Pelts}} will still be rewarded to the player, as if the player had killed it themselves. The mob's behavior is decided based on its rarity and type. {{stat|Tracking}} increases the chance to find {{Gold|Elusive}} animals. 

Given the chances below, players will earn an average of {{Pelts|4.12|approx=y}} per quest. This is increased to {{Pelts|4.15|approx=y}} per with {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 9}}, as well as an additional {{Pelts|1}} each with {{Item|Pelt Belt}}, another {{Pelts|1}} each with {{Item|Jake's Plushie}}, totaling to {{Pelts|9.15|approx=y}} per quest with all buffs.

Other buffs are added before {{Gray|the multiplier from {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}} (discontinued)}}, and the amount of {{Pelts}} rewarded is rounded up.

